{"title":"Career Roadmap · Shipping Legal Executive","role":"Shipping Legal Executive","summary":"A Shipping Legal Executive supports shipping companies, shipowners, charterers, logistics companies, ports, maritime insurers, ship managers, freight operators and maritime law firms on the legal and contractual aspects of shipping operations.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Aviation / Space / Maritime Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Shipping Legal Executive supports shipping companies, shipowners, charterers, logistics companies, ports, maritime insurers, ship managers, freight operators and maritime law firms on the legal and contractual aspects of shipping operations."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Maritime Law","Commercial Law","Contracts","Shipping Operations","Insurance","International Trade"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reviewing shipping contracts"},{"text":"Drafting and negotiating maritime agreements"},{"text":"Handling charter-party documentation"},{"text":"Supporting vessel purchase/sale transactions"},{"text":"Reviewing bills of lading"},{"text":"Assisting with cargo claims"},{"text":"Supporting maritime insurance matters"},{"text":"Researching maritime regulations"},{"text":"Coordinating with ports, agents and insurers"},{"text":"Assisting in maritime disputes and arbitration"},{"text":"Monitoring regulatory compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"It is particularly suitable for students interested in international commerce, transportation, logistics, ports, ships, trade and commercial law."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Integrated Law Degree","Contract + Commercial Law Foundation","Maritime / Shipping Law Specialization","Shipping / Port / Maritime Law Internship","Shipping Contracts + Documentation","Cargo / Vessel / Insurance Knowledge","Junior Shipping Legal Executive","Shipping Legal Executive","Senior Legal Executive / Maritime Legal Associate","Legal Manager – Shipping","Head of Legal / Maritime Legal Counsel"]}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Legal & Commercial Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"Core areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constitutional law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Legal methods"},{"text":"Torts"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Legal writing"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Business fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reading contracts"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Case analysis"},{"text":"Statutory interpretation"},{"text":"Professional writing"},{"text":"Business communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Commercial Law Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the legal knowledge needed for shipping transactions."},{"type":"h","text":"Important subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Company law"},{"text":"Commercial law"},{"text":"Sale of goods"},{"text":"Civil procedure"},{"text":"Law of evidence"},{"text":"Insurance law"},{"text":"Banking/finance fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Begin studying"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International trade"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Transportation contracts"},{"text":"Commercial documentation"},{"text":"Risk allocation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Maritime Law Specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"This should be the primary specialization stage."},{"type":"h","text":"Study"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maritime law"},{"text":"Admiralty law"},{"text":"Shipping contracts"},{"text":"Carriage of goods by sea"},{"text":"Marine insurance"},{"text":"Maritime liens"},{"text":"Vessel registration"},{"text":"Ship mortgages"},{"text":"Maritime claims"},{"text":"Port regulations"},{"text":"Charter parties"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the shipping ecosystem"},{"type":"flow","items":["Shipowner","Ship Manager","Charterer","Port / Terminal","Shipping Agent","Carrier","Freight Forwarder","Cargo Owner","Insurer / P&I Club"]},{"type":"p","text":"A legal executive should understand the contractual relationships between these parties."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Shipping Transactions & Disputes"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from theory toward practical application."},{"type":"h","text":"Focus areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Charter-party agreements"},{"text":"Bills of lading"},{"text":"Vessel sale and purchase"},{"text":"Ship financing"},{"text":"Marine insurance"},{"text":"Cargo claims"},{"text":"Demurrage"},{"text":"Detention"},{"text":"Maritime liens"},{"text":"Vessel arrest"},{"text":"Port disputes"},{"text":"Maritime arbitration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important documents"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to identify and understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bill of lading"},{"text":"Charter party"},{"text":"Fixture recap"},{"text":"Delivery order"},{"text":"Notice of readiness"},{"text":"Statement of facts"},{"text":"Cargo claim documents"},{"text":"Marine insurance policy"},{"text":"Ship management agreement"},{"text":"Ship sale and purchase agreement"},{"text":"Loan/security documents"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Professional Shipping Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The final year should combine maritime law with commercial and international practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International maritime conventions"},{"text":"Maritime dispute resolution"},{"text":"International commercial arbitration"},{"text":"Shipping finance"},{"text":"Marine insurance"},{"text":"Port and terminal agreements"},{"text":"Vessel transactions"},{"text":"Maritime environmental compliance"},{"text":"Sanctions and trade compliance"},{"text":"International trade documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year objective"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should be capable of assisting a senior lawyer with:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Shipping Contracts","Maritime Research","Vessel Documentation","Cargo Claims","Regulatory Compliance","Legal Risk Analysis"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Core Maritime Law Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Shipping Legal Executive should understand the legal framework surrounding:"},{"type":"h","text":"Vessels"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vessel ownership"},{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Flag states"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Ship mortgages"},{"text":"Vessel acquisition"},{"text":"Vessel sale"},{"text":"Vessel arrest"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cargo"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cargo ownership"},{"text":"Carriage contracts"},{"text":"Cargo damage"},{"text":"Cargo loss"},{"text":"Delay"},{"text":"Delivery disputes"},{"text":"Bills of lading"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial Shipping"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chartering"},{"text":"Freight"},{"text":"Demurrage"},{"text":"Laytime"},{"text":"Detention"},{"text":"Port operations"},{"text":"Logistics contracts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marine insurance"},{"text":"Protection & Indemnity"},{"text":"Hull & Machinery"},{"text":"Cargo insurance"},{"text":"Subrogation"},{"text":"Claims management"}]}]},{"heading":"International Maritime Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should develop familiarity with major international maritime instruments and institutions."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IMO framework"},{"text":"SOLAS"},{"text":"MARPOL"},{"text":"STCW"},{"text":"UNCLOS"},{"text":"Hague/Hague-Visby Rules"},{"text":"Hamburg Rules"},{"text":"Rotterdam Rules"},{"text":"Maritime Labour Convention"},{"text":"International maritime safety stan